OL,2,V55555555CMODERATES TRIUMPH
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CIN BASQUE POLL
OL,5, The moderate Basque Nationalist Party
OL,6, has won the regional elections in
OL,7, northern Spain and is set to govern the
OL,8, Basque region for another four years.
OL,10, But it took only 32 of the 75 seats and
OL,11, lost its overall majority.
OL,13, The Socialists, who want tougher action
OL,14, against terrorism, finished second (19
OL,15, seats), ahead of the Separatists (11).
OL,17, The poll was marred by an escalation of
OL,18, the political violence that has plagued
OL,19, the Basque region for 16 years.
OL,21, The Separatist coalition is likely to
OL,22, continue its boycott of the Basque
OL,23, parliament.
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,497,190,120,250,0,100
PN,49609
SC,0009
CT,25,T
