OL,6, FIREBOMB BLITZ HITS PROVINCE   R (/q
OL,7,                                R ,'!$#!
OL,8, Firebombers have attacked four stores
OL,9, in N Ireland after an earlier alert.
OL,11,FJust hours after police warned business
OL,12,Fowners to check their premises,
OL,13,Fincendiary devices went off in Lisburn,
OL,14,FCo Antrim, Belfast and Glengormley.
OL,15,F
OL,16,FNobody was injured and police said that
OL,17,Fdamage in most cases was minor. A
OL,18,Fdevice found earlier in a shop led to
OL,19,Fthe warnings.
