OL,6, TEN KILLED BY ALTAR BOMB     V"/=&
OL,7,F                           V
OL,8, Two wired rockets planted under the
OL,9, altar blew up during Sunday mass at a
OL,10, church near Beirut, killing at least 10
OL,11, worshippers and wounded 60,police said.
OL,12,F
OL,13,FSurvivors of the blast said pools of
OL,14,Fblood covered the floor of the Catholic
OL,15,FNotre Dame de la Deliverance church.
OL,16,F
OL,17,FWitnesses said dozens of people were
OL,18,Ftaking communion when the altar blew
OL,19,Fup. The fate of the priest is not known
OL,20,A---------------------------------------
OL,21,   FNext story follows in a momentH>>
