OL,6, HEATH WARNS TORIES OVER POLL   R (/q
OL,7,                                R ,'!$#!
OL,8, Former PM Sir Edward Heath has urged
OL,9, John Major to mount a "full-blooded"
OL,10, campaign for the European elections.
OL,12,FHe warned that a "lukewarm" effort
OL,13,Fwould not bring in the votes.
OL,14,F
OL,15,FAnd he hit out at Tory Euro-sceptics
OL,16,Fsuch as Social Security Secretary,
OL,17,FPeter Lilley, saying they had no vision
OL,18,Fand wanted a "little isolated British
OL,19,Fisland".
OL,20,A---------------------------------------
